"Nemours Children&amp;#39;s Health. &lt;a href=&quot;https://kidshealth.org/en/parents/cuts-sheet.html&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;What to do about cuts.&lt;/a&gt;",
"National CPR Foundation. &lt;a href=&quot;https://nationalcprfoundation.com/courses/standard-first-aid-3/choking/&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Choking, hypothermia &amp;amp; dehydration&lt;/a&gt;.",
"Merck Manual Professional Edition. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/critical-care-medicine/how-to-do-basic-airway-procedures/how-to-do-the-heimlich-maneuver-in-the-conscious-adult-or-child#Relevant-Anatomy_v52127291&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;How to do the Heimlich maneuver in the conscious adult or child.&lt;/a&gt;",
"National Library of Medicine. &lt;a href=&quot;https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/000048.htm&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Choking - infant under 1 year&lt;/a&gt;.",
"American Red Cross. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redcross.org/take-a-class/resources/learn-first-aid/adult-child-choking&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Adult &amp;amp; child choking: symptoms and first aid.&lt;/a&gt;",
"American Burn Association. &lt;a href=&quot;http://ameriburn.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/burnfirstaid.pdf&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Initial first aid treatment for minor burns&lt;/a&gt;.",
"National Library of Medicine. &lt;a href=&quot;https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/000030.htm&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Burns&lt;/a&gt;.",
"MedlinePlus. &lt;a href=&quot;https://medlineplus.gov/ency/patientinstructions/000662.htm&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Minor burns - aftercare.&lt;/a&gt;",
"Hyland EJ, Connolly SM, Fox JA, Harvey JG. &lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.18773/austprescr.2015.041&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Minor burn management: potions and lotions&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Aust Prescr&lt;/em&gt;. 2015;38(4):124-127. doi:10.18773/austprescr.2015.041",
"American Academy of Dermatology Association. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aad.org/public/everyday-care/injured-skin/burns/prevent-treat-blisters&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;How to prevent and treat blisters.&lt;/a&gt;",
"National Library of Medicine. &lt;a href=&quot;https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/000001.htm&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Broken bone&lt;/a&gt;.",
"Wheatley BM, Nappo KE, Christensen DL, Holman AM, Brooks DI, Potter BK. &lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.5435/jaaos-d-17-00727&quot; data-component=&quot;link&quot; data-source=&quot;inlineLink&quot; data-type=&quot;externalLink&quot; data-ordinal=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Effect of NSAIDs on bone healing rates: a meta-analysis&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;J Am Acad Orthop Surg&lt;/em&gt;. 2019;27(7):e330-e336. doi:10.5435/JAAOS-D-17-00727",
