<h1 id="article-heading_1-0" class="comp article-heading"> Basic First Aid to Help Manage 10 Emergencies
</h1>
<p id="article-subheading_1-0" class="comp article-subheading"></p>
<div id="article-meta_1-0" class="comp article-meta mntl-article-meta mntl-block not-news" data-tracking-container="true"><div id="bylines_1-0" class="comp bylines health-bylines mntl-bylines"><div id="mntl-bylines__group_1-0" class="comp mntl-bylines__group mntl-block mntl-bylines__group--author "><div id="mntl-bylines__item_1-0" class="comp mntl-bylines__item mntl-attribution__item mntl-attribution__item--has-date">
