<p class="author-bio__bio-text" >
<span class="author-bio__bio-title">By <a href="https://www.verywellhealth.com/rod-brouhard-emt-p-1298152">Rod Brouhard, EMT-P</a></span>
<br>
Rod Brouhard is an emergency medical technician paramedic (EMT-P), journalist, educator, and advocate for emergency medical service providers and patients.
</p>
